<title>USA: Commercial Intertech names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Commercial Intertech names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>YOUNGSTON, Ohio 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Intertech Corp said on Thursday it named Steven Hewitt chief financial officer and senior vice president, effective December 1.</p>
<p>Hewitt, 47, would replace Hubert Jacobs van Merlen, 43, who resigned effective November 30 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Hewitt joined Commercial Intertech in 1969 and has been manager of corporate financial analysis and division controller. He became vice president and controller earlier in 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
